WEBVTT

00:20:57.070 --> 00:21:01.342
these amazing coincidences, shall we say,

00:21:01.366 --> 00:21:03.271
that seem to have no other explanation

00:21:03.295 --> 00:21:07.233
than that there is this purposefulness
to the ideas that are out there.

00:21:07.257 --> 00:21:11.442
Can you tell us the story about
your Amazon novel that never was?

00:21:11.466 --> 00:21:13.576
That strikes me as just
an astonishing story.

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:16.339
EG: Oh, god. OK, I haven't told
this story in a long time.

00:21:16.363 --> 00:21:18.469
Let me see if I can get the timing right.

00:21:19.096 --> 00:21:26.084
So, I had an idea to write a story
about the Amazon jungle.

00:21:26.108 --> 00:21:28.810
I actually went to my publisher,
I came with a proposal.

00:21:28.834 --> 00:21:31.296
This was a novel that I had dreamed up,